  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global competence centre for augmented, virtual and mixed reality (AR/VR/MR) technologies in the North East Region (NER)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The North East MP&apos;s Forum, Government of India has requested UNIDO&apos;s support in the application of 4th industrial revolution technologies for industry in the North East region of India, through the setup of a centre of excellence. In complement to the above the demand for such a project and the necessary support has been articulated by both Assam Electronics De velopment Co-operation Limited (AMTRON) and Numaligarh Refinery Limited (NRL). Both of which are key public sector institutions in the NE. In light of the above, a preparatory assistance phase is sought in order to validate and finalize the technical aspects of the project document, including identification of suitable sites and vet technical project partners.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regular Programme Of Technical Cooperati</narrative>
